and head-only fine-tuning (no_goggle {{recipe/val/clean/no_goggle/recall_candidate_r2_head_only|count}} of {{recipe/val/clean/no_goggle/recall_candidate_r2_head_only|n}}).
Because the incumbent's checkpoint was selected on the validation split, this check is biased towards the incumbent.

